{
	"version": 1,
	"files": [
		{
			"path": "README.md",
			"contents": "# Video workflow\n\nThis folder keeps the brief, script, shot plans, generated artifacts, and clip order as ordinary local files. Ask an Agent to expand or revise the workflow, or edit any file and node directly.\n\n## Clip order\n\n`video-sequence.json` is an ordered list of exact Video results. Each item keeps the Video node's relative path, stable node id, and one successful run or imported revision id. A later run does not silently change the arranged result. Use **BaseHalf: Add Current Video to Sequence…** to add an exact verified Current, **BaseHalf: Show Video Sequence Status…** to verify pins, **BaseHalf: Move Video Sequence Clip…** to change playback order, **BaseHalf: Update Video Sequence Clip to Current…** to accept a different verified Current explicitly, and **BaseHalf: Remove Video Sequence Clip…** to remove only the playback-order reference.\n"
		},
		{
			"path": "brief.md",
			"contents": "# Creative brief\n\nDescribe the story, audience, format, visual direction, duration, and non-negotiable constraints.\n"
		},
		{
			"path": "script.md",
			"contents": "# Script\n\nTurn the creative brief into scenes, action, and dialogue. Keep each intended shot easy to identify.\n"
		},
		{
			"path": "shots/shot-01/storyboard.md",
			"contents": "# Shot 01\n\n## Visual beat\n\nDescribe what the viewer sees.\n\n## Camera and motion\n\nDescribe framing, camera movement, subject movement, and timing.\n\n## Dialogue and sound\n\nDescribe speech, music, ambience, and effects.\n\n## Continuity\n\nRecord what must match the shots before and after this one.\n"
		},
		{
			"path": "shots/shot-01/shot.json",
			"contents": "{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"pointa.basehalf-ai-video.shot\",\n  \"id\": \"shot-01\",\n  \"title\": \"Shot 01\",\n  \"clipNodePath\": \"clip.bhnode\"\n}\n"
		},
		{
			"path": "video-sequence.json",
			"contents": "{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"kind\": \"pointa.basehalf-ai-video.sequence\",\n  \"items\": []\n}\n"
		}
	],
	"nodes": [
